# Real HTTP 301s for legacy /writing/* URLs -> /articles/*
# (previously these only got a client-side <meta http-equiv="refresh"> from
# src/pages/writing/[slug].astro, which Astro.redirect(...,301) cannot turn
# into a real header on a static build with no SSR adapter — live returned
# 200, not 301. This Cloudflare Pages _redirects rule fixes that at the edge,
# no rebuild required for the redirect itself.)
/writing/*  /articles/:splat  301
